{"SEAQ_WINTER","",{"Cold, short, and quiet, it makes people sit still","Not much to like, the fire, a blanket, the quiet","I don't mind it, everything slows down, even them","Hard on the old and the hungry"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Christmas is coming, I haven't decided how I feel about that"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Winter's honest, it tells you what you're made of"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=law,swat",{"Too many nights, too little firewood"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Winter ops are a pain - gear freezes - people freeze"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Cold keeps the dead slow, that I like"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Winter's hard, hard on everyone, but it has its beauty","I don't like it, I never have, but I respect it","It's a season of waiting, and I'm not good at waiting","The snow covers everything, even the dead, and I'm grateful for that","Short days -- long nights, and nothing to do but think...","It keeps the dead slow, I'll say that for it","I could do without it, but I'll take the quiet","Winter makes us honest, there's nowhere to hide","I'd trade it for spring in a heartbeat","Breath comes out white and the ground crunches, hate every bit of it","It's the worst time to be homeless... and the best time to be kind"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|hour=20,5",{"It's cold, it's dark, it's lonely, and I'm still here"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"It's winter, what do you expect?"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Winter's coming, or here, either way, it's going to get ugly, folks will turn on each other","Winter's my favorite, nobody's out, and the ones who are, are desperate"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Winter on the block is brutal, no heat, no lights, no nothing"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Winter, we hole up, {g:brother|sister}, drink, wait it out"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Winter reduces competition, a grim sort of efficiency"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Winter's the worst, you can't escape it, it follows you inside"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Winter is long, friend, and the first one is always the hardest"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Winter will thin the herd, the infected and the survivors alike"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Winter operations require extra supplies, which we don't have"}},
{"SEAQ_WINTER","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"We've stacked wood, canned beans, and dried apples, winter doesn't scare us"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","",{"Haven't seen it come down like this since the March storm","A few times, not like this, and never with this on my mind","It's beautiful, honestly, terrible time for it","Snow quiets everything, for once, I'm grateful","Keep an eye on your feet - tracks show"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Look at it come down, used to be a day off school"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Back in '85 we got twelve inches in a night - this is close"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=law,swat|world=road",{"Roads going to be ice by dark"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Snow's cover and exposure both, plan for it"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hell of a time for snow - Footprints everywhere"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"It's snowing! it's actually snowing, look at that, look!","Snow, silent and soft, I almost forgot how pretty it is","It covers everything, the blood, the mess, the memories","The flakes are so big, you could count them","It's beautiful, and it's terrible, because it means the cold","Snow hides footprints, but it shows them, too, depending","I haven't seen snow like this since I was a kid","Every flake is different, and every one of them is cold","Quiet snow, the quietest sound in the world","Winter is here to stay, and I'm not ready","It's coming down hard... we'd better find shelter","The kids will want to play in it, and I'll let them, just for a minute"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Snow? So?"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"I like snow better when I don't have to put up with it","Pretty enough. I don't have to like it just because it's pretty"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Snowing! Man, the whole block looks like a postcard, for a minute I forgot"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Falling snow, {g:brother|sister}, the quietest thing in the world"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"There is something peaceful about snowfall, even now"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow, snow, it's snowing, I want to stand in it and cry"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow covers tracks, good for me, good for you too"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Snowfall will slow everyone down, be careful driving, if you're driving"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow in the forecast, wrap up, keep your weapons dry"}},
{"SNOWQ_FALLING","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow's falling, kids are out sledding, God bless them, it's the only joy we have"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","",{"It's been lying for days - gets dirty","Packed down hard - Slippery as glass underneath","Cold underfoot, wet in the boots - nothing new","It'll melt, then the mud starts","Look at the prints, everyone who's passed through"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"The kids built a snowman once in the yard, still there, I'd bet"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Don't walk on the ditch side - looks solid - isn't"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=law,swat",{"Fresh tracks, somebody's close - old ones don't matter"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=military,elite",{"Snow covers the dead, I try not to wonder where"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"The snow's deep, up to my knees in places, and every step is work","Footprints everywhere, so everyone can see where everyone has been","It's pretty, I'll admit, and a pain","The drifts are high, and the dead are stuck in them, almost funny","It's slick... so watch your step, I've already fallen twice","White as far as the eye can see, and not a living thing","It hasn't melted in days, and I think it's here to stay","Beautiful, but treacherous","It muffles sound, so listen close","The sun on the snow is blinding, so, squint","Cold feet, cold hands, warm heart, I guess","It makes the world look clean -- and it lies"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"It's snow, what do you want me to say?"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow on the ground, easy to track, easy to be tracked, so watch where you walk","Footprints in the snow, every one tells a story, mine tell the wrong one"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow's piled up, can't walk without leaving a trail"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Packed snow's slick, {g:brother|sister}, can't even push a bike through it"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow cover is a double-edged sword, as it reveals as much as it hides"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Everything's white and clean, it almost looks like nothing bad happened"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Read the snow, friend, it tells you who walked here and when"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow cover helps tracking, check for recent prints before you move"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow cover is good for signature management, bad for stealth"}},
{"SNOWQ_GROUND","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Snow's deep, we dug paths between the barn and the house, so nobody gets lost"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"No, no, sorry, we can't risk it","Not here, find another place"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"Move on, not here"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=military,elite|st=careful",{"Negative, move on"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"Not a chance, kid"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Stay? NEVER, you'd murder us in our sleep"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=law,swat|st=hostile",{"You'll sleep in a cell"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=military,elite|st=hostile",{"Negative, you're hostile"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Stay? Sure, in a shallow grave"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law,swat,military,elite|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Alright, hands stay up - walk toward me slow"}},
{"SURRENDER","tmp=veteran|st=neutral,careful",{"Good, that's the smart call, nobody moves fast now"}},
{"SURRENDER","tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"I don't want your surrender, I want you gone"}},
{"SURRENDER","tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"You're not my prisoner, just walk away and stay away"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law,military,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Put it on the ground, step back off it - both feet"}},
{"SURRENDER","tmp=fresh|st=neutral",{"Just-- nobody do anything sudden, all right? Nobody"}},
{"SURRENDER","tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"Too easy, you're holding something back"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=outlaw,crime,club|tmp=seasoned",{"We take the bag, you keep the boots, deal's a deal"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=raider,prison|tmp=predator|mood=grim",{"Surrender's a word for people with a jail to go to"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=gang,crime|st=hostile",{"Yeah, you give up, everybody gives up - empty the bag"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=warm",{"Then it's over - thank God - it's over"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|mood=grim",{"I'm not taking anybody prisoner - go home, if you've got one"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=club|tmp=veteran",{"Kneel there till my people are past, then you're free"}},
{"SURRENDER","tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|mood=funny",{"You look ridiculous with your hands up, go on, leave"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=rescue_clergy|mood=warm",{"Bless you for stopping, I know it wasn't easy... go on"}},
{"SURRENDER","tmp=veteran|st=careful|hour=16,5",{"Accepted - don't make me regret it before dark"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"On your knees, nice and slow, hands where I can see 'em","Smart move, I like smart people, they live longer","You give up? Already? I haven't even gotten started","On the ground, face down, and don't try anything stupid","Hold that thought, let me go through your pockets"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"You give up?! Too late, {g:buddy|lady}, too late!","Shut up! I'll decide if you give up!"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Hey, hey, relax, nobody's gonna hurt you, you can stand up","Easy, I believe you, I'm not a monster"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Aight, drop it, drop everything, and get on the ground","You gave up quick, not bad, now empty your pockets","Good, now don't move"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"You give up? Nah, you don't get to give up"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"You're good, you're good, nobody's hurting you"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Smart man, now toss your weapons and stay where you are","Surrender accepted, {g:brother|sister}, now be real still"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Easy, easy... nobody's killing anybody today"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Very sensible, now let's discuss the terms","I accept your surrender, though it may not be as comfortable as you hope","Surrender, such a dramatic word - let's call it an arrangement, you arrange to leave"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=crime|st=hostile",{"Surrender is not an option, I'm afraid"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Of course, let's all calm down and talk"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"You won, you won- I won't hurt you, just stay right where you are","You give up? So do I, I'm so tired, I'm so tired of this","Hahaha, you surrender? Last time I said that, I got a number sewn on my shirt"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"You can't give up, I won't let you! I don't believe you!"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"It's okay, it's okay, no one's gonna hurt you, I promise"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Smart, now drop everything and back away","Alright, nobody needs to get hurt"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"It's okay, friend, take it easy"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Good, I need you to place your hands behind your head and kneel","Thank you, keep your hands visible, I'm going to approach","You're doing the right thing, just stay calm"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law|st=hostile",{"On the ground, now, face down, hands behind your back!","Face down! Spread your arms! Palms up! Don't you move until I say!"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law|st=friendly",{"It's okay, you're safe, nobody is going to hurt you"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Stand by, hands behind your head, do not move","Surrender acknowledged, remain still"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=military|st=hostile",{"On your knees, NOW!"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=military|st=friendly",{"You're safe, friend, we're not going to hurt you"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Uh... what do I do now? Nobody taught us this part"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Drop your gun and stand back, nice and slow"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=militia|st=friendly",{"It's alright, friend, nobody wants any trouble"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Thank you, thank you, I won't forget this, I won't forget your mercy","Oh, bless you, I'm so sorry, for everything","You're letting me go? You're really letting me go? Oh God, thank you"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Smart, good, now let's all walk away from this","Fine, you win, happy now?","Alright, I accept, nobody gets hurt"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,neutral",{"Don't try anything, I'm watching your hands"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh thank you, dear, thank the Lord"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Surrender accepted, stand down, hands where I can see them"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law,swat|st=careful,neutral",{"On your knees, hands behind your head, now"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Surrender accepted, stand down"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=military,elite|st=careful,neutral",{"Hands on your head, now"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hahaha, smart move, kid, you might live after all","Alright, you're breathing, congratulations"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"On your knees, now, or I change my mind"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Too late for that, {g:pal|lady}"}},
{"SURRENDER","st=friendly,neutral",{"I hear you, saying that doesn't make this place safe"}},
{"SURRENDER","st=careful",{"Keep your hands visible, I'm still watching you","Kneel down where you are - hands on your head till I'm out of sight","Then you won't mind turning around and walking twenty paces off"}},
{"SURRENDER","st=hostile",{"I'm not agreeing to anything","Too late for that, you should've said it before you came at me","Giving up doesn't undo what you did back there"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=neutral,friendly",{"I don't want a prisoner, I don't know what to do with one"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law,swat|st=neutral,careful",{"Don't reach for anything, no sudden movements"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=military,elite|st=neutral,careful",{"Keep clear, no custody arrangement has been made"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm not here to take you prisoner, just give me room"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=worker|st=neutral,careful",{"This isn't something I know how to handle - keep back"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=club,outlaw,crime|st=careful,hostile",{"I'm not making you any promises for saying that"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=raider,gang,prison|st=hostile",{"You're asking for mercy, you're not buying it"}},
{"SURRENDER","st=friendly",{"Surrender? Honey, we weren't fighting - put your hands down, you're scaring me","Nobody's winning anything - sit down a minute and catch your breath"}},
{"SURRENDER","st=neutral",{"Fine by me, I never wanted a fight - go on your way","Good, then we're done here - walk that way and keep walking"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful",{"You surrender? To me? Okay - okay, um, just stay there - please don't change your mind"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful,neutral",{"I don't know how this works! Do I take your gun? I don't want to touch your gun!"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=neutral",{"Oh thank God, I thought one of us was going to die - I think I'm going to be sick"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=hostile",{"Stay down! I'm not falling for it! My cousin fell for that and they took his truck!"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|sex=f",{"You don't have to surrender to me, I'm just a lady from Riverside with a rolling pin"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=family_man|st=careful",{"Okay, just lie there till my wife and kids get past - then you can go - please"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=family_youth|st=careful,neutral",{"Seriously? Uh - okay - stay right there, I'm getting my dad"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|st=careful|world=building",{"Smart - take your boots off and set 'em by the mailbox - they'll be there when I'm gone"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,hostile",{"I've seen folks give up and come back with friends - turn your pockets out first"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral,careful",{"Good, now sit, because that cut on your arm needs looking at and I'm not doing it while you swing"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Then let's both be done with it, nobody's keeping score out here but the Lord"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=rescue_firefighter|st=careful,neutral",{"Alright, lay it on the ground and scoot back, I'm not taking it, just making sure"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=law_deputy,law_officer|st=careful",{"Good choice, turn around, walk backwards toward my voice - stop, down on your knees"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|st=careful,neutral",{"Smartest thing anybody's said to me since Friday, fingers laced behind your head"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=law_trooper|st=careful,hostile",{"State Police, you are being detained - cross your ankles - don't look back at me"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral,careful",{"You're doing good, do exactly what I say and we all go home - well, we all go somewhere"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=law_corrections|st=careful,hostile|world=building",{"Hands on the wall - feet back, I did this a hundred times a week at the county jail, so don't get creative"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law|st=neutral|day=7,9999",{"I'm not arresting you, I don't have a jail left to put you in - go, and don't let me see you again"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=swat|st=hostile",{"Down! Hands out to your sides! Moving to cuff! Don't you move!"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=swat_lead|st=careful",{"Subject surrendering - two, cover - three, search, you, not a twitch"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=swat|st=neutral",{"Accepted, you get searched, then released - ain't no more to it"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=soldier_nco|st=hostile",{"On your knees! Hands on your head! Sanchez, flex cuffs!"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=military|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"Surrender accepted, you'll be screened for bites - sleeves up, collar down - slowly"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=soldier|st=neutral|world=road",{"Roger - sit on the curb, somebody with more stripes than me decides what happens next"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=soldier_green|st=careful,neutral",{"Sergeant! He's surrendering! What do I do? What's the procedure?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=military|st=careful",{"Walk toward the white Humvee, hands visible, nice and slow"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=military|tmp=veteran,seasoned|st=neutral,hostile|day=20,9999",{"Surrender to who? There's no command left to hand you over to"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=elite_delta|st=careful,hostile",{"Down, face in the dirt - hands out"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=elite_operator|st=careful,neutral",{"Compliance noted - stay down five minutes after we leave"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"Surrender's a word for armies, I'm not an army - walk"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=outlaw|st=careful,neutral",{"First sensible thing I've heard all day, set it all down and back away real slow"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"I surrendered my stripes to a ditch on the Tuesday - it's overrated - just leave"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=raider|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Aw, you give up? Boys, he gives up! That's my favorite part - strip him"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=raider|tmp=predator|st=hostile,careful",{"Smart - knees, now thank me for the privilege - louder"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=raider_boss|st=hostile,careful",{"Surrender means what's in your pockets is mine, and what's in your truck - keys - now"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=raider|st=careful,neutral",{"Stay down and count to five hundred, out loud, you stop, I come back"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=gang|st=hostile|world=road",{"That's right, you give up - lay flat, everything in your pockets goes on the curb"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile,careful",{"Smart man - stay on your knees where the whole block can see - that's how they learn"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=club|st=careful,hostile",{"Alright, kneel by the bikes - prospect, check him for iron"}},
{"SURRENDER","role=biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"You quit clean - that's respect, you keep your teeth for it"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=crime|st=hostile,careful",{"Good, now forget my face, forgetting it is the most valuable thing you'll ever do"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Nah, see, surrender's what you do for the law, I ain't the law - empty out"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law,swat,military|st=careful,neutral",{"You're going to do exactly what I say, when I say it - are we clear on that?"},false,{[1]="SURRENDER"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=law,swat,elite|st=careful",{"Hands on your head, on your knees - can you do that without any trouble?"},false,{[1]="SURRENDER"}},
{"SURRENDER","reg=raider,gang,prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Giving up's easy, staying give up is the hard part - you up for the hard part?"},false,{[1]="SURRENDER"}},
{"SWEAR_VENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I know, I KNOW, this is hell, this is absolute hell, I want to scream too","Same here, same, I want to curse the sky, curse the Army, curse everyone","G-go ahead... let it out, nobody's listening, nobody cares, scream if you want","God damn it, you're right, God DAMN it, this is a nightmare","I feel it too, every word, every curse, every tear"}},
{"SWEAR_VENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yep, it's a hell of a thing, no way around it","Go on, cuss, I do it too","Damn right, damn right, we've earned a good curse...","It never gets easier... but cursing helps, a little..."}},
{"SWEAR_VENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I'm with you, brother, sister, friend, shout all you want, I'll shout with you","Go on, yell, I won't tell"},false,false,{[2]={{t="I'll swear with you",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"SWEAR_VENT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Watch that mouth before I shut it for you!","Quiet, you'll draw them","Watch your mouth","Keep your temper and your voice down, angry people shoot first"}},
