{"VISIT_TELL_HEADCOUNT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|fact=visit_asks_headcount",{"Is it just you in there? Anybody else? Kids? I only ask because I'm worried","How many people live here? Are you alone? Because nobody should be alone out here","Do you have anyone with you? Family? I'd feel better knowing you aren't alone","Anyone else in the house? Just curious, no reason, just asking","How many are you? I can find some extra blankets, if you need them, I'm just trying to help","Is it just you in there? I'm only asking because I worry","How many are you, if you don't mind? So I know how many blankets to leave","You've got a big place, how many live in there?","Anybody else there with you? Just curious","Seems a lot of space for one person, are you alone?"}},
{"VISIT_TELL_HEADCOUNT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|fact=visit_asks_headcount",{"So, how many of you in there? Two? Five? Ten? Just curious","Anybody else around? Like, a lot of people? Or just you?","Nice big place, lots of people in there? Or just you?","How many mouths in there? Just curious, not planning anything"}},
{"VISIT_TELL_HEADCOUNT","reg=law,swat|fact=visit_asks_headcount",{"How many residents are in the property? I need a number for my report","How many residents, for my records?"}},
{"VISIT_TELL_HEADCOUNT","fact=visit_asks_headcount",{"Anybody else staying here with you?","How many people should I expect to meet?","Is it just you here, or are there others?","Do you have anybody keeping you company?","Anyone else I ought to know about before I come closer?"}},
{"VISIT_TELL_PAY_FIRST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|fact=visit_pay_first",{"Payment first, then I show you the goods, that's how I do business","Hand yours over before I open the bag, nobody gets burned that way","Up front, friend, up front, I've been robbed too many times","You put your payment in my hand first, then I'll show you, deal?","Pay first, look second, it's the only way I trade now","Cash on the barrel, or whatever you're using, show me first","Pay first, that's my rule, I've been burned","Put your payment in my hand, and then I'll show you the goods","No credit, no tricks, cash first, goods second","You first, friend, I learned the hard way","Hand it over, and the deal is yours"}},
{"VISIT_TELL_PAY_FIRST","fact=visit_pay_first",{"I want payment before we go any further","Hand your share over first, then we'll talk","Up front, that's what I'm asking","Not showing you anything until I see what you're offering","You first, I'm not taking the chance"}},
{"VISIT_TELL_WHERE_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|fact=visit_looks_past_you",{"That's a nice place, which room do you sleep in? Upstairs? Down here?","You sleep on the ground floor, or up there? Just wondering, it's a nice house","Where do you keep your bed? Near the front? The back? Sorry, I'm rambling","Beautiful place, which room do you sleep in? Is it nice and warm?","Where do you sleep at night? Upstairs or down here?","I bet you've got a comfy bed in there, where is it?","Do you sleep near the door, or farther back?"}},
{"VISIT_TELL_WHERE_SLEEP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|fact=visit_looks_past_you",{"Nice digs, where do you sleep? In case we need to find you, you know, to say hi","Cozy, where do you rest your head? Just wondering"}},
{"VISIT_TELL_WHERE_SLEEP","reg=law,swat|fact=visit_looks_past_you",{"Where's the sleeping area? Standard question for safety, that's all","Where's the sleeping area? Safety question"}},
{"VISIT_TELL_WHERE_SLEEP","fact=visit_looks_past_you",{"Where do you try to sleep in a place like this?","Got a quiet spot, or do you sleep wherever you can?","Do you stay near the entrance when you rest?","Where would you stop for the night?","Do you keep everybody together when it's time to rest?"}},
{"WARMQ_COLD","",{"Get a fire going first, always","Layers, and keep moving - don't sit on cold ground","Stuff newspaper in your coat, old trick from my granddad","Wet is the enemy - stay dry, change your socks","Hot water in a bottle, wrapped in a towel, works in bed, too","Hat on, it's the cheapest heater you own"}},
{"WARMQ_COLD","world=door,window",{"Find a house, shut the door, shut the curtains, the heat stays"}},
{"WARMQ_COLD","world=building",{"Stand near the stove, not too near, learned that the hard way"}},
