{"WARMQ_COLD","role=rescue_medical",{"Keep warm?"},false,false,{[1]={{t="Don't stop moving, and don't fall asleep outside, ever",afterMs=2200}}}},
{"WARMQ_COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Layers on layers, a hat, two pairs of socks, I look ridiculous","I huddle near a fire, if I can find one, and I wrap up tight","Keep your feet dry, that's most of it, wet feet and you're done","Newspaper under your jacket, it helps, it does","We share body heat, sleep back to back, it's a little awkward, but it works","Hot water in a bottle, wrapped in a towel, tuck it in your bedroll","A hot drink... if you've got one, even just hot water, helps..","Wool, wool, wool, cotton kills","Burn what you can, wood, paper, furniture, I'm not proud","Wrap your head, you lose heat through your head, they say"}},
{"WARMQ_COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Eat something fatty, it burns slow, like a log in a stove","Stay out of the wind, find a wall, any wall, and sit with your back to it"}},
