{"WINQ_WINTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Cold as a well-digger's heart, and twice as long","We get snow -- and we get ice, and then we get both at once","Nights are the worst, they stretch forever","Last winter, the pipes froze, and the whole town was without water for a week","It's a test, every year, and this year it's a bigger one","Firewood is gold... food is silver, hope is bronze","We hunker down, burn what we have, and wait for spring","Snowed in for days, with nothing but a deck of cards and a bad attitude","The cold finds every crack in the house","It's quiet, and beautiful, and deadly","We lose people in winter, every year, it's just how it is"}},
